                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【MASTER &amp; MASTER RIP】MASTER - Madonna - Material Girl (Master Clean DV 576i)]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/madonna-material-girl-master-clean-dv-576i.307970/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					I would say this is the <b>best source</b> of <i>Material Girl</i> we have so far. It's better than the versions on <a href="https://sharemania.us/threads/madonna-the-immaculate-collection-dvd-iso-pal.304376/" class="internalLink">The Immaculate Collection</a> and <a href="https://sharemania.us/threads/madonna-celebration-the-video-collection-dvd-iso-ntsc.304161/" class="internalLink">Celebration: The Video Collection</a> DVDs.<br>
<br>
Here's a comparison:<br>
<i>The Immaculate Collection </i>(DVD, PAL):<br>
<img src="https://i.ibb.co/zwZDv6q/vlcsnap-2026-08-17-21h44m28s661-The-Immaculate-Collection.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/zwZDv6q/vlcsnap-2026-08-17-21h44m28s661-The-Immaculate-Collection.png" style=""> <br>
<i>Celebration: The Video Collection</i> (DVD, NTSC):<br>
<img src="https://i.ibb.co/W4VTJ3Wx/vlcsnap-2026-08-17-21h44m28s662-Celebration.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/W4VTJ3Wx/vlcsnap-2026-08-17-21h44m28s662-Celebration.png" style=""> <br>
Master Clean DV 576i:<br>
<img src="https://i.ibb.co/CLcxP6t/vlcsnap-2026-08-17-21h44m28s661.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.ibb.co/CLcxP6t/vlcsnap-2026-08-17-21h44m28s661.png" style=""> <br>
If you look at Madonna's teeth, for example, and compare them with the corresponding screenshots, you can see that they are most clearly visible in the <b>DV master</b>. What I also like about this master is that, unlike the usual SD ProRes master, it isn't cropped at all.<br>
